📱 Indian Smartphone Market Analysis
Overview
This repository contains an end-to-end Business Intelligence solution analyzing the hyper-competitive Indian smartphone market. Built entirely in Power BI, this interactive dashboard transforms raw industry data into an executive-ready interface, empowering stakeholders to make data-driven decisions regarding pricing strategies and competitive positioning.

🚀 Dashboard Features & Capabilities
Dynamic Financial KPIs: Features engineered measures to calculate and monitor critical business metrics, including overall sales volumes, revenue growth, and vendor profit margins across diverse market segments.

Market Share & Brand Tracking: High-impact visualizations illustrate brand performance over time, tracking shifting consumer purchasing preferences and market share distribution among top competitors.

Geographical Sales Trends: Highlights emerging regional sales trends to identify high-growth opportunities and geographic market penetration.

Strategic Narrative: Designed with a clear visual hierarchy that translates technical data points into actionable business intelligence for executive stakeholders.

🛠️ Data Architecture & Tech Stack
Core Technology: Power BI Desktop

Data Transformation (ETL): Utilized Power Query (M Code) to rigorously clean, structure, and standardize complex raw market datasets.

Data Modeling: Built a robust relational data model that ensures instantaneous cross-filtering, dynamic drill-downs, and seamless dashboard interactions for the end user.

Domain Skills: Data Visualization, Market Analytics, Business Intelligence.
